The reference blend contains frangipani, capillary wormwood, kapok, sophora flower, chrysanthemum and honeysuckle. [Wing Joo Loong](https://www.wjl.com.sg/products/wing-joo-loong-lung-soothing-summer-tea) does not disclose their growing countries.

